  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Budget and Financial Accountability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Programs provide long-term, resident advisors or short-term, intermittent advisors. Budget Policy and Financial Accountability Program advisors support counterpart government institutions to reform and strengthen their public financial management systems; to promote control, accountability and transparency over resources; and to improve the countrys overall financial condition.</narrative>
